      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This week, FENDI released the Baguette® 26424 bag from its Spring/Summer 2027 runway collection in a limited online drop. Crafted from supple Pergamena lambskin, the body is outlined with black nappa calfskin and metal studs — a nod to a 1933 archival trunk. The black-and-white contrast and studded detailing lend the bag a rebellious, punk-inflected edge.",
